Z||000009||turbo86se||06-20-2000||12:18 AM||||Thanks Tim!!  I really appreciate you posting the pics!  I doubt anyone else would mind!  THIRD PLACE MY FOOT!!!  I hope Curry doesn't see that!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> LOL!<P>DXR_DAD: The scoop sure does look sweet on a black 86SE, but you already know that!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>I had the paint shop glass the scoop on, I couldn't do it! Those guys did a great job. It really helps dissipate heat. I can see the heat vapors emmitting while I'm at idle. Now if I could find one of those cool screens to go in the opening...<P>Also Tim, if you get this 87GT, you gotta get TOM's scoop!!  Since I found it, do I get it on weekends?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>||||reg||10
Z||000010||zeusrekning||06-20-2000||06:47 AM||||Yeah sure, you can drive it any time you want. That is what friends are for. Just leave the keys for your turbo 86. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||6
